                <original>と考えております</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="418" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:30,719</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:33,240</end-time>
                <translation>如果说在《存在与时间》中</translation>
                <original>もしですね存在と時間で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="419" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:33,240</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:37,386</end-time>
                <translation>海德格尔还有什么需要更深入思考的地方</translation>
                <original>ハイデガーがもっと考えるべきことがあったとしたら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="420" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:37,386</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:40,038</end-time>
                <translation>那就是取回本真性的此在
それは本来性を取り戻した現存在が</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="421" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:40,038</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:42,654</end-time>
                <translation>该如何与他者产生关联</translation>
                <original>どのように他者と関わるべきなのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="422" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:42,654</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:44,643</end-time>
                <translation>以及产生关联后该怎么做呢？</translation>
                <original>関わっていくのかということを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="423" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:44,643</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:47,904</end-time>
                <translation>希望能在书中将这点讲明吧</translation>
                <original>明らかにすることだったのではないかと思っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="424" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:47,904</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:51,076</end-time>
                <translation>这对于生活在21世纪的我们而言</translation>
                <original>これは21世紀を生きる 私たちにとっても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="425" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:51,076</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:54,069</end-time>
                <translation>也绝非事不关己的课题</translation>
                <original>決して他人事ではない課題なのかなと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="426" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:54,069</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:56,792</end-time>
                <translation>不如说 正因为身处这个时代</translation>
                <original>むしろこの時代だからこそ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="427" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:56,792</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:59,014</end-time>
                <translation>才要对孤独和与他人的相处方式更加警惕吧</translation>
                <original>より気をつけなければならないんじゃないかな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="428" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:59,014</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:03,476</end-time>
                <translation>在讨论过程中 我也隐约感受到了类似的问题</translation>
                <original>みたいなのも話の途中途中感じたんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="429" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:03,476</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:05,197</end-time>
                <translation>在阅读的过程中</translation>
                <original>読んでいく最中に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="430" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:05,197</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:07,363</end-time>
                <translation>能引发我们多方面的思考</translation>
                <original>いろいろなことを考えさせてくれると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="431" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:07,363</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:11,504</end-time>
                <translation>我认为这正是这本书非常有趣的地方</translation>
                <original>いうのがこの本のすごく面白いところかなと思っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="432" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:11,504</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:13,020</end-time>
                <translation>就像干农活一样</translation>
                <original>畑仕事みたいに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="433" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:13,020</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:15,411</end-time>
                <translation>每天读上几页</translation>
                <original>毎日数ページみたいに読んでいくと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="434" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:15,411</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:18,117</end-time>
                <translation>我想这样就能最终读完吧</translation>
                <original>読破できるのかなと思いますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="435" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:18,117</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:20,160</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院 这次你感觉如何？</translation>
                <original>伊集院さん今回はいかがでしたか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="436" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:20,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:24,120</end-time>
                <translation>正好现在我自身也有不少困惑</translation>
                <original>ちょうど今自分で迷っていることが結構あって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="437" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:24,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:25,514</end-time>
                <translation>比如人际关系之类的
人間関係とか</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
