            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="438" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:25,514</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:27,578</end-time>
                <translation>与人共有价值观</translation>
                <original>人と価値観を共有することは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="439" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:27,578</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:29,621</end-time>
                <translation>早就知道是很困难的了</translation>
                <original>難しいとはしていたものの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="440" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:29,621</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:31,395</end-time>
                <translation>但没想到其实更难</translation>
                <original>やっぱ難しいな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="441" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:31,395</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:32,524</end-time>
                <translation>既然如此</translation>
                <original>だったら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="442" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:32,524</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:36,448</end-time>
                <translation>是不是应该把精力集中在更少人数能完成的范围内呢</translation>
                <original>もっと少ない人数でやれる範囲のものに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="443" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:36,448</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:39,226</end-time>
                <translation>去建社群会更好吧 不好意思说的不明不白的</translation>
                <original>した方がいいんじゃないか漠然としててごめんなさい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="444" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:39,226</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:40,659</end-time>
                <translation>以为上回的结论就够的时候</translation>
                <original>そういうものを思っている時に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="445" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:40,659</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:43,974</end-time>
                <translation>没想到最结尾的时候被阿伦特这么一说</translation>
                <original>最後の最後にアーレントにあれを言われちゃうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" torder="1" index="446" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:43,974</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:47,773</end-time>
                <translation>不 果然还是要再好好想想吧</translation>
